Promt Create a poster of a city blockbuster that feautures a city at night with tall,buildings flying cars, spaceships and portals being open in the sky. Add a astronaut looking at all of this. Use a sharp geometric vertical line from the fall buildings to guide the viewers eyes towards the astronaut and the buildings.Also use ireggular ,curved lines from broken wires,smoke everywhere and damaged places to create movement and chaos. The main shapes should be tall rectangles from the buildings.Leave some space in the dark sky so the city and teh astronaut feel lonely and isolated. the astronaut should have a stong sense of volume and mass so it wont look flat. The brightest areas need to be the tall buildings and the main focus needs to be the astronaut.
Vocabulary Breakdown Lines:Lines can guide your eyes or show movement In my poster, the building lines lead toward the astronaut and the curved lines make the scene feel chaotic.Shape:is the form of an object My main shapes are tall rectangles of the buildings, and the shapes of the cars, spaceships, and astronaut. Texture:is how something looks like it would feel. I use rough textures on the damaged buildings, wires, and other parts of the city.Volume: makes something look like it has depth. I use volume on the astronaut so they wont look flat.Contrast:is the difference between light and dark. The bright buildings against the dark sky help the astronaut stand out
